    4 │   age: 50
  > 5 │   name: Jane Doe
      │   ^^^^
    6 │ 
    7 │ person2: { name: John, age: 50, name: Jane }
  
  i Duplicate keys make the mapping ambiguous, and tools disagree on which value wins.
  
  i Remove or rename the duplicate keys.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  
